WEBVTT

00:00:15.010 --> 00:00:22.080
Looking up at the purple panorama of the galaxy highway...

00:00:24.050 --> 00:00:30.190
...a shooting star pierces my heart.

00:00:30.360 --> 00:00:38.000
synchronized with the sleepless city...
My accelerating heartbeat is

00:00:39.280 --> 00:00:44.770
...and I suddenly pray for the unseen tomorrow...

00:00:45.640 --> 00:00:50.010
...that brings that melody.

00:00:51.810 --> 00:00:56.950
A mysterious voice won't let me go.

00:00:57.490 --> 00:01:03.560
Oh, tell me seventh moon, this frustrated heart...

00:01:04.560 --> 00:01:09.330
...where will you take me to?

00:01:09.770 --> 00:01:15.840
To sway in the blue seventh moon...

00:01:16.270 --> 00:01:25.750
...searching for the answer to the rhythm in this crazy dance.

00:01:32.950 --> 00:01:34.580
Previously on Macross 7.

00:01:35.450 --> 00:01:37.890
This battle is senseless !
Listen to my song !

00:01:41.930 --> 00:01:44.200
Captain, that...
That weapon... !

00:01:44.670 --> 00:01:47.000
Faced with death,
their Spiritia rises.

00:01:54.020 --> 00:01:59.180
Their vital functions are slowly deteriorating.
They're hovering on the brink of death.

00:01:59.180 --> 00:02:00.940
They just don't have
the will to live.

00:02:09.000 --> 00:02:11.030
The Spiritia is being
raised by his terror.

00:02:14.750 --> 00:02:20.120
Gigil, retrieve the samples collected
by the soldiers who infiltrated the ship.

00:02:20.580 --> 00:02:23.900
Gepelnitch is using
me as a errand boy !

00:02:25.780 --> 00:02:26.720
Bobby !

00:02:30.660 --> 00:02:33.400
Spiritia level lowered to 12.
Data collection complete.

00:02:33.400 --> 00:02:40.630
And yet this time we're toying with them.
Why aren't we attacking all at once ?

00:02:45.900 --> 00:02:49.080
Lately, I have been
dreaming often.

00:02:49.080 --> 00:02:53.420
A dream of obtaining Spiritia
without having to hunt for prey.

00:02:56.850 --> 00:02:59.450
Spiritia level... 20... 25...

00:02:59.450 --> 00:03:01.140
Her Spiritia level is recovering...

00:03:01.140 --> 00:03:08.930
50... 52... 55...it is confirmed,
Sample GLQ is regenerating Spiritia.

00:03:09.280 --> 00:03:12.390
It is now possible...
The Spiritia Farm Project.

00:03:33.130 --> 00:03:35.120
Guvava ! Guvava !

00:03:45.460 --> 00:03:50.120
As a gift, it's great, but no matter how
you slice it, it's not made for driving in.

00:03:52.560 --> 00:03:58.500
Spiritia Farm

00:04:02.230 --> 00:04:06.650
Say, I tried rearranging yesterday's
song from scratch, like you explained...

00:04:08.190 --> 00:04:10.320
What are you doing,
dressed up like that ?

00:04:11.580 --> 00:04:14.300
Looks good, doesn't it ?
What do you think ?

00:04:14.300 --> 00:04:16.460
Aren't you going
a bit overboard ?

00:04:16.460 --> 00:04:18.550
What's that supposed to mean ?

00:04:18.550 --> 00:04:20.700
It doesn't really lend
itself to going wild.

00:04:20.700 --> 00:04:23.050
I'm not wearing it because
I intend to go wild.

00:04:23.050 --> 00:04:24.350
Is that so ?

00:04:24.930 --> 00:04:26.000
The nerve !

00:04:26.990 --> 00:04:29.050
Ray, I'll catch you later.

00:04:29.050 --> 00:04:30.100
Uh, right.

00:04:30.100 --> 00:04:31.870
You're not going to practice ?

00:04:31.870 --> 00:04:33.000
I have a date.

00:04:33.900 --> 00:04:35.410
Is that so ?
Don't push yourself.

00:04:37.440 --> 00:04:39.100
I'm not pushing myself !

00:04:54.950 --> 00:04:57.160
I'm sorry, making
you wait and all.

00:04:58.060 --> 00:04:59.360
Not at all.
Please, have a seat.

00:05:06.010 --> 00:05:08.660
Miss Mylene has
just arrived.

00:05:08.660 --> 00:05:11.710
Her outfit truly
suits her well.

00:05:11.710 --> 00:05:13.480
The fact that she's
usually in a rock...

00:05:13.480 --> 00:05:16.050
I don't care about that.

00:05:16.050 --> 00:05:17.090
Just keep a
close eye on her.

00:05:17.090 --> 00:05:18.060
Y...yes, sir.

00:05:23.170 --> 00:05:24.780
How nice...

00:05:24.780 --> 00:05:26.450
Well, it's so elegant...

00:05:26.450 --> 00:05:29.060
No, not really.

00:05:29.060 --> 00:05:32.510
You seem like a
mature young lady.

00:05:33.460 --> 00:05:34.940
You really think so ?

00:05:34.940 --> 00:05:35.990
Yes.

00:05:39.160 --> 00:05:42.280
Umm...Miss Mylene,
do you like singing ?

00:05:42.280 --> 00:05:43.620
Huh ? Singing ?

00:05:44.020 --> 00:05:46.750
You know, singing in front
of people, and such.

00:05:49.540 --> 00:05:52.110
I sing karaoke a lot !

00:05:52.680 --> 00:05:55.140
Oh, is that so ?
That's right !

00:05:55.480 --> 00:05:56.620
That's right !

00:06:01.320 --> 00:06:02.250
Miss Mylene !

00:06:06.350 --> 00:06:07.320
Oh, no !

00:06:08.480 --> 00:06:09.210
Guvava !

00:06:09.970 --> 00:06:11.250
Guvava ?

00:06:11.250 --> 00:06:12.680
This is Guvava.

00:06:12.680 --> 00:06:15.210
Um...we're always together.

00:06:16.110 --> 00:06:17.390
Guvava...

00:06:18.360 --> 00:06:19.860
It's okay, Guvava.

00:06:20.350 --> 00:06:22.280
I got him from Dad.

00:06:22.280 --> 00:06:25.030
It was a souvenir from
the Pukirases system.

00:06:25.030 --> 00:06:26.480
Is that so ?

00:06:26.980 --> 00:06:30.170
He's like a mirror of me...
Isn't he cute ?

00:06:32.330 --> 00:06:33.350
He's cute, indeed.

00:06:35.530 --> 00:06:37.930
It'd be horrible
if it stained...

00:06:37.930 --> 00:06:39.360
Please excuse me for a bit.

00:06:49.130 --> 00:06:51.510
I wonder if it'll come out...
Oh, man !

00:07:17.730 --> 00:07:21.390
I don't understand why she'd leave,
leaving this creature behind.

00:07:21.390 --> 00:07:22.630
A kidnapping, huh ?

00:07:23.330 --> 00:07:25.780
We found someone that
could be an eye witness.

00:07:25.780 --> 00:07:28.300
So, it is indeed a kidnapping.

00:07:29.300 --> 00:07:31.950
Yes...I don't have
all the details...

00:07:31.950 --> 00:07:35.450
...but it seems Miss Mylene
has been abducted by someone.

00:07:35.450 --> 00:07:39.120
You twit ! Why do you think
I sent you there in the first place ?

00:07:39.120 --> 00:07:41.760
I don't want any more excuses !
Do whatever it takes to find her !

00:07:42.990 --> 00:07:44.380
My most humble apologies.

00:07:44.380 --> 00:07:48.240
I'm extremely sorry, but Miss Mylene
appears to have been abducted by someone.

00:07:48.240 --> 00:07:50.220
What ?!

00:07:51.750 --> 00:07:54.230
Bringing you here
was a mistake.

00:07:54.670 --> 00:07:57.800
In any case, you go out there
and look for Mylene, too.

00:07:57.800 --> 00:08:00.660
If anything happens to her,
I won't forgive you !

00:08:01.490 --> 00:08:02.840
Yes, I understand.

00:08:06.800 --> 00:08:08.470
I'm sorry to
keep you waiting.

00:08:08.470 --> 00:08:10.630
Now that the preparations are
complete, I was able to come.

00:08:11.860 --> 00:08:12.700
What's wrong ?

00:08:13.290 --> 00:08:15.100
It seems Mylene's
been kidnapped.

00:08:16.330 --> 00:08:17.460
What ?!

00:08:17.460 --> 00:08:21.510
And now, Kareda Scarling,
29 years old.

00:08:21.510 --> 00:08:24.180
He was driving alone late at
night when he was kidnapped.

00:08:24.180 --> 00:08:27.630
The car he was driving was found
abandoned in the service area.

00:08:29.280 --> 00:08:34.490
In just the past week alone, the number
of missing people has climbed to over 20.

00:08:34.490 --> 00:08:38.180
Our only conclusion so far
is that they were kidnapped.

00:08:39.180 --> 00:08:40.560
An awful lot of people...

00:08:40.880 --> 00:08:45.880
Ruling out abduction for profit, I believe
it's more likely an act of the enemy.

00:08:45.880 --> 00:08:50.690
If that's so, this action clearly differs
from the enemy's previous patterns...

00:08:51.230 --> 00:08:54.440
Could they be stealing
the people themselves ?

00:08:55.500 --> 00:08:59.370
I'm not sure if this
is merely coincidence...

00:08:59.370 --> 00:09:03.280
...but Gina Brittman,
of Macross 7's Section C...

00:09:03.280 --> 00:09:06.700
...and Frederick Baum, Section E,
are also missing.

00:09:09.800 --> 00:09:14.420
Aside from those two, are there any
similarities to the other abductees ?

00:09:14.420 --> 00:09:15.930
No, not one.

00:09:15.930 --> 00:09:20.390
Anyway, all we can do is form a
special operations team to look for them.

00:09:25.340 --> 00:09:27.460
It's about Mylene, but...

00:09:27.460 --> 00:09:31.230
I'm going to set aside a separate segment
of the operation to look for Mylene.

00:09:31.230 --> 00:09:33.100
You don't need
to worry about it.

00:09:34.570 --> 00:09:37.870
There's no way they're going to get
away with taking people from City 7.

00:09:44.280 --> 00:09:48.250
What are your results on the analysis of
those samples with elevated Spiritia levels ?

00:09:48.250 --> 00:09:52.530
If we limit our analysis to these samples,
their Spiritia levels seem to be unlimited.

00:09:52.530 --> 00:09:56.260
The plan will proceed
to the next stage...

00:09:56.990 --> 00:09:59.430
...the Spiritia Farm Project.

00:10:00.090 --> 00:10:03.540
What of our plans to take
more samples in the future ?

00:10:03.540 --> 00:10:06.310
The time for my dream
to be realized has come.

00:10:10.570 --> 00:10:13.230
Hey, you bastards !
What'd you do with Miss Mylene ?

00:10:14.840 --> 00:10:16.730
You better not
be hiding her !

00:10:16.730 --> 00:10:20.590
Miss Mylene's been kidnapped !
You guys wouldn't know why, would you ?

00:10:25.130 --> 00:10:26.330
Hey...wait !

00:10:28.410 --> 00:10:30.280
You better fix that !

00:10:30.280 --> 00:10:31.640
You bastards...

00:10:35.530 --> 00:10:37.130
Ray, what'd they say ?

00:10:37.730 --> 00:10:40.450
It seems like she was taken right
in the middle of her date.

00:10:40.450 --> 00:10:43.240
Only Guvava was
left at the scene.

00:10:43.240 --> 00:10:45.920
It must've been
rough, huh, Guvava ?

00:10:45.920 --> 00:10:49.230
And what about her date ?
Some good he was.

00:10:49.230 --> 00:10:50.780
What the hell was he doing ?

00:10:53.600 --> 00:10:57.340
A suspicious truck carrying some cargo
was apparently in this loading dock.

00:10:57.340 --> 00:10:58.950
Huh ? Who are you ?

00:11:00.030 --> 00:11:02.300
It was my companion
who was kidnapped.

00:11:02.300 --> 00:11:06.320
Oh, it's you...the hyperactively
helpful boyfriend.

00:11:06.320 --> 00:11:08.330
And, about that
suspicious looking truck ?

00:11:08.330 --> 00:11:12.630
Oh, right. That truck...
it didn't seem to be from this district.

00:11:12.630 --> 00:11:18.680
Hey ! Someone witnessed a truck leaving
here about the same time as the kidnapping.

00:11:18.680 --> 00:11:20.270
There's no mistake...

00:11:20.270 --> 00:11:23.690
Okay, let's go. We should at
least check out that truck.

00:11:23.690 --> 00:11:24.650
Yes, sir !

00:11:28.280 --> 00:11:29.740
Could she be that way ?

00:11:29.740 --> 00:11:31.690
Hey, what's going on ?

00:11:31.690 --> 00:11:33.640
He knows where Mylene is.

00:11:36.110 --> 00:11:37.030
Ray, let's go !

00:11:37.030 --> 00:11:38.030
Right.

00:11:57.310 --> 00:11:58.970
Guvava, I'm counting on you.

00:12:01.130 --> 00:12:03.920
Hey, Guvava, which way ?
Left ? Straight ?

00:12:06.330 --> 00:12:07.690
Fine, this way, huh ?

00:12:17.030 --> 00:12:21.940
Captain Max, the number of missing
people has increased by one !

00:12:23.030 --> 00:12:26.300
Robert Moraise, working
in Fold Section B.

00:12:27.290 --> 00:12:30.130
Fold ?
While on duty ?

00:12:30.130 --> 00:12:31.980
No.
During his break.

00:12:31.980 --> 00:12:36.630
I wonder if they plan to interfere in the
gentle lives of the people of Macross 7.

00:12:36.630 --> 00:12:38.630
It'd be better if they
kidnapped me instead.

00:12:50.570 --> 00:12:52.530
So she's around
here somewhere, huh ?

00:12:52.530 --> 00:12:54.820
Searching each one of
these will be rough.

00:12:58.640 --> 00:13:00.830
Hey ! What're you
guys doing here ?

00:13:02.790 --> 00:13:04.280
What's wrong ?

00:13:04.280 --> 00:13:06.630
We've arrived at the location
specified by the witness.

00:13:08.610 --> 00:13:10.670
Nekki Basara ! Bastard !

00:13:12.690 --> 00:13:14.660
What are you doing here ?!

00:13:14.660 --> 00:13:16.010
And what about you ?

00:13:16.010 --> 00:13:17.940
Do you know these people ?

00:13:17.940 --> 00:13:19.080
Uh, yes...

00:13:19.080 --> 00:13:21.280
Unfortunately,
we're acquaintances.

00:13:21.280 --> 00:13:23.580
Let me handle these guys.

00:13:23.580 --> 00:13:24.970
Quickly, look for the truck.

00:13:24.970 --> 00:13:25.720
Right...

00:13:26.580 --> 00:13:29.450
The truck is definitely
hidden around here.

00:13:29.450 --> 00:13:30.480
Let's split up
and look for it.

00:13:30.480 --> 00:13:31.530
Right.

00:13:31.530 --> 00:13:35.170
Why ?!  Why are you
always getting in my way ?

00:13:35.170 --> 00:13:37.210
It has nothing
to do with you.

00:13:37.210 --> 00:13:39.960
We're just looking
for a friend.

00:13:39.960 --> 00:13:42.590
Why are you, a pilot,
in this search operation ?

00:13:43.520 --> 00:13:45.540
I'm looking
for Miss Mylene.

00:13:45.540 --> 00:13:46.930
Mylene ?!

00:13:46.930 --> 00:13:49.330
You ?!  You were the
one she was with ?

00:13:50.330 --> 00:13:51.350
Guvava ?

00:13:51.350 --> 00:13:53.080
Pull yourself together.

00:13:53.080 --> 00:13:55.100
Can't even take
care of your date.

00:13:55.600 --> 00:13:57.780
And what's the deal with
you guys and Miss Mylene ?

00:13:57.780 --> 00:13:59.110
Why do you have Guvava ?

00:13:59.110 --> 00:14:00.480
It's none of your business.

00:14:00.480 --> 00:14:02.180
It is too my business !

00:14:02.180 --> 00:14:04.340
She's a member of our band.

00:14:04.930 --> 00:14:06.160
M...Miss Mylene is ?

00:14:06.160 --> 00:14:09.080
You didn't even
know that ? Man !

00:14:09.080 --> 00:14:11.840
Wait ! I'll go
look for Miss Mylene.

00:14:11.840 --> 00:14:13.880
You go look for
her if you want.

00:14:13.880 --> 00:14:15.580
You won't find her, though.

00:14:20.390 --> 00:14:23.660
Lord Gepelnitch. A message
from undercover unit GRU.

00:14:23.660 --> 00:14:27.780
The plan is going smoothly. They request
an update on the retrieval vessel.

00:14:27.780 --> 00:14:29.030
Very well.

00:14:29.030 --> 00:14:30.880
Gigil, begin the assault.

00:14:30.880 --> 00:14:31.710
Yes, sir.

00:14:42.130 --> 00:14:43.230
All right !

00:14:43.230 --> 00:14:44.450
Ready to go for it ?

00:14:44.450 --> 00:14:45.180
Yep !

00:14:48.990 --> 00:14:51.330
What the hell are
you trying to do ?

00:14:51.330 --> 00:14:53.130
Sing a song, of course.

00:14:53.130 --> 00:14:56.030
This is no time
for a concert !

00:14:56.030 --> 00:14:58.680
There's no other way
to search a place this big.

00:14:58.680 --> 00:15:01.360
Mylene's a member
of Fire Bomber.

00:15:01.360 --> 00:15:04.140
If our song reaches her,
she'll definitely respond.

00:15:04.140 --> 00:15:05.360
"If our song reaches her ?"

00:15:05.360 --> 00:15:07.600
There's no way
you'd understand.

00:15:07.600 --> 00:15:09.230
"If our song reaches her ?!"

00:15:09.230 --> 00:15:15.250
Let's get started, it's Saturday night.
How're you guys doing ?

00:15:15.250 --> 00:15:19.340
Let's stand up, do you feel the beat ?

00:15:21.350 --> 00:15:27.480
This is a flying paradise.
A forgotten energy...

00:15:27.480 --> 00:15:31.990
Now hurry up and take it back.

00:15:34.120 --> 00:15:36.640
No more wastin' time.

00:15:36.640 --> 00:15:46.340
Before everything fades away like a dream.

00:15:48.180 --> 00:15:54.250
Hey, everybody !
Aim at the light.

00:15:54.250 --> 00:15:59.730
Let's dance. Dancing on the planet dance.

00:16:01.470 --> 00:16:07.270
A liar sings a sad song of surrender.

00:16:07.270 --> 00:16:11.580
No thanks ! You're of no help.

00:16:11.580 --> 00:16:12.580
Basara ?

00:16:13.310 --> 00:16:19.310
Ever-changing constellations and
invisible sweat and tears...

00:16:19.310 --> 00:16:24.020
...brings courage into my heart.

00:16:26.000 --> 00:16:32.030
No more wastin' love, don't ruin your love.

00:16:32.030 --> 00:16:37.610
Someone must be looking only at you.

00:16:40.060 --> 00:16:41.280
Hey, everybody ! Straight from your heart...

00:16:41.280 --> 00:16:43.650
Why is she singing in a place like this ?

00:16:43.650 --> 00:16:44.900
And dressed like that...?
Hey, everybody ! Straight from your heart...

00:16:44.900 --> 00:16:46.140
Hey, everybody ! Straight from your heart...

00:16:46.140 --> 00:16:53.520
Let's shout. Jumpin' on the planet dance.

00:16:53.520 --> 00:16:59.300
A liar sings a sad song of surrender.

00:16:59.300 --> 00:17:03.330
No thanks ! You're of no help.

00:17:03.330 --> 00:17:03.550
Hey, you !
No thanks ! You're of no help.

00:17:03.550 --> 00:17:05.490
Hey, you !

00:17:05.490 --> 00:17:11.280
Ever-changing constellations and
invisible sweat and tears...

00:17:11.280 --> 00:17:16.370
...brings courage into my heart.

00:17:17.990 --> 00:17:23.920
No more wastin' love, don't ruin your love.

00:17:23.920 --> 00:17:29.420
Someone must be looking only at you.

00:17:31.990 --> 00:17:38.030
Hey, everybody ! Straight from your heart...

00:17:38.030 --> 00:17:44.560
Let's shout. Jumpin' on the planet dance.

00:17:45.290 --> 00:17:46.480
Guvava, what's wrong ?

00:17:54.280 --> 00:17:55.790
She's in the basement.

00:17:55.790 --> 00:17:57.670
Our song reached her.

00:17:57.670 --> 00:17:59.210
I...impossible !

00:17:59.210 --> 00:18:00.380
Ray, let's go.

00:18:03.020 --> 00:18:03.800
Wait !

00:18:06.550 --> 00:18:09.180
Did they really find
her with that song ?

00:18:11.130 --> 00:18:13.180
Yes ? This is D-2.

00:18:13.180 --> 00:18:14.640
Gamlin !
It's the enemy !

00:18:14.640 --> 00:18:15.980
We've got to launch !

00:18:15.980 --> 00:18:17.030
Roger.

00:18:20.600 --> 00:18:22.010
I'm counting on
you for this !

00:18:29.340 --> 00:18:33.000
Many small craft. Medium craft 18.
1 large craft.

00:18:33.000 --> 00:18:35.750
Approaching area 412.

00:18:35.750 --> 00:18:37.980
Defense line, operation phase 3.

00:18:37.980 --> 00:18:41.840
It appears that they are attempting
to retrieve the people they abducted.

00:18:41.840 --> 00:18:44.000
Don't let even one of
them get close to us.

00:18:52.110 --> 00:18:53.690
All right, that's it.

00:18:53.690 --> 00:18:57.120
D-1 to team.
Don't let one of them close !

00:18:57.120 --> 00:18:58.240
Roger !

00:18:58.390 --> 00:19:00.830
No way I'm letting
them steal Miss Mylene !

00:19:05.470 --> 00:19:07.670
Now you've done it !
Attack !

00:19:43.780 --> 00:19:44.780
Guvava !

00:19:48.580 --> 00:19:50.130
They're going to take
them in a container.

00:19:51.690 --> 00:19:52.480
Guvava !

00:19:52.480 --> 00:19:54.290
They've already
been taken away.

00:19:56.950 --> 00:19:58.750
Airlock G-18, eh ?

00:20:00.550 --> 00:20:02.680
Container with samples has arrived.

00:20:04.340 --> 00:20:07.130
Load immediately
into transport craft.

00:20:11.580 --> 00:20:13.080
Let me make
it in time !

00:20:13.080 --> 00:20:17.070
Unable to open
airlock during combat.

00:20:23.090 --> 00:20:24.250
Damn you !

00:20:24.940 --> 00:20:28.340
The transport craft containing
the samples will launch in 010.

00:20:28.610 --> 00:20:32.070
All right !  Let's get the
transport and take it back.

00:20:44.280 --> 00:20:46.510
Sorry, but there
won't be a song today !

00:20:47.680 --> 00:20:49.430
Pinpoint barrier punch !

00:21:05.410 --> 00:21:06.240
All right !

00:21:19.520 --> 00:21:21.690
Basara !

00:21:24.500 --> 00:21:26.130
Basara, I heard your song !

00:21:26.130 --> 00:21:28.050
I heard yours too.

00:21:28.280 --> 00:21:30.500
Guvava really did it all.

00:21:31.160 --> 00:21:32.240
Thanks, Guvava.

00:21:35.540 --> 00:21:36.530
What's going on ?

00:21:48.560 --> 00:21:49.370
What the...?

00:22:01.370 --> 00:22:02.740
What's going on here ?

00:22:03.400 --> 00:22:06.250
The emergency separation systems
have been forced to start up !

00:22:06.490 --> 00:22:07.640
What ?!

00:22:10.920 --> 00:22:12.310
What ?
What's going on ?

00:22:18.430 --> 00:22:21.430
Captain !
City 7 is going to fold !

00:22:21.950 --> 00:22:25.470
This was the enemy's
real objective.

00:22:28.740 --> 00:22:31.730
Damn ! Using me
as a decoy again !

00:22:35.170 --> 00:22:36.890
City 7 !

00:23:07.210 --> 00:23:13.390
Our voices synchronize just like falling in love and kissing.

00:23:16.220 --> 00:23:23.530
My heart is always here for you.

00:23:25.630 --> 00:23:30.700
But, oh! I wonder what your shining eyes...

00:23:31.810 --> 00:23:39.680
...are searching for ? Oh, My Friends !

00:23:40.870 --> 00:23:51.360
I'm going to run with you toward a star where our dreams are.

00:23:53.260 --> 00:24:03.070
When we look at each other everything will become real.

00:24:11.450 --> 00:24:13.730
Preview

00:24:13.730 --> 00:24:14.350
We've been separated
from the fleet !
Preview

00:24:14.350 --> 00:24:16.240
We've been separated
from the fleet !

00:24:16.240 --> 00:24:18.470
Pipe down, it feels really good
not havin' soldiers around !

00:24:18.470 --> 00:24:22.020
What do you mean ?
We're lost somewhere in space !

00:24:22.020 --> 00:24:23.490
Next time, "Fold Out" !

00:24:23.490 --> 00:24:23.990
Fold Out
Next time, "Fold Out" !

00:24:23.990 --> 00:24:26.180
My song is going to go wild !
Fold Out

